My first ascencion was a Valkyrie who lost Mjollnir on the Medusa level but
had Vorpal Blade as a backup until she stumbled upon Frost Brand in one of
the Castle storerooms.  The only weapon potentially more deadly is
Grayswandir against silver-hating creatures (and that's for Lawfuls).
Although Mjollnir does more damage at +0, its "shock value" is constant.
On the other hand, Fire/Frost Brand's attack bonus increases with enchantment.
Also, war hammers aren't terribly good weapons, so it takes forever to kill
shock-resistant creatures.

>  Basically if you are a neutral character, and get a FrostBrand, don't 
